WEBVTT

01:31.640 --> 01:32.700
=The Road to Splendor=

01:32.700 --> 01:34.760
(Adapted from China Literature author
Zhizhi's novel of the same name)

01:35.280 --> 01:37.960
=Episode 35=

01:40.660 --> 01:42.900
It bears the seal of the Anzhou
Prefectural Office.

01:44.180 --> 01:44.859
Then this matter

01:45.579 --> 01:46.499
can be considered done.

01:47.419 --> 01:48.219
Then can we

01:48.299 --> 01:49.820
return to the capital and report back?

01:51.380 --> 01:52.980
When the Three Judicial Offices
convene for the trial,

01:53.579 --> 01:54.579
it will be the day
when those responsible

01:55.660 --> 01:57.339
finally answer for what they did
to Lord Shen.

01:58.980 --> 02:00.460
I can only block this water route
for one day.

02:01.100 --> 02:01.980
After today,

02:01.980 --> 02:03.100
I don't know what I can do.

02:03.620 --> 02:04.859
As for the official salt from Minzhou,

02:05.180 --> 02:06.460
I can only move a few thousand catties.

02:06.660 --> 02:08.100
There's no way to put it
into circulation.

02:08.419 --> 02:09.179
What will you

02:09.419 --> 02:10.299
do next?

02:11.739 --> 02:13.419
Evidence from Anzhou alone

02:13.699 --> 02:15.179
won't be enough to bring down
Grand Secretary Yu.

02:16.100 --> 02:17.459
If we want the officials

02:17.699 --> 02:19.299
to join together and testify
against him,

02:20.179 --> 02:20.780
Feiyu,

02:21.260 --> 02:22.139
you're with the Imperial Guards.

02:22.459 --> 02:23.260
You're more reliable than I am.

02:24.299 --> 02:25.820
We need to split up.

02:25.899 --> 02:27.220
The identity of Jiuweijiao

02:27.220 --> 02:28.299
won't last much longer.

02:29.419 --> 02:30.019
From now on,

02:30.340 --> 02:31.100
I'll work in the open,

02:31.459 --> 02:32.139
and you'll work in the shadows.

02:32.540 --> 02:33.739
As long as I hold out long enough,

02:34.139 --> 02:35.699
I'll buy you more time.

02:37.540 --> 02:38.459
Then what about you?

02:38.980 --> 02:40.100
Don't worry, Lord Qin.

02:40.179 --> 02:41.820
Before we became officials,

02:41.820 --> 02:42.940
we were bandits.

02:43.260 --> 02:44.380
The ability to survive

02:44.380 --> 02:45.100
is something we were born with.

02:47.780 --> 02:49.579
But you're traveling everywhere
so people across the realm

02:49.579 --> 02:50.540
can have salt to eat.

02:54.660 --> 02:56.060
Your safety matters more than mine.

02:56.739 --> 02:57.340
From now on,

02:58.699 --> 02:59.579
I'll cover you.

03:04.100 --> 03:04.859
I

03:05.100 --> 03:05.540
will not

03:05.619 --> 03:06.540
fail you.

03:14.780 --> 03:16.699
I wonder how things
are going in the capital.

03:42.260 --> 03:44.540
I wonder how he's doing now.

03:45.380 --> 03:46.579
Mr. Zhao

03:46.579 --> 03:47.899
always had a way out.

03:48.459 --> 03:49.299
Madam,

03:49.299 --> 03:50.699
don't worry about him.

03:52.820 --> 03:53.660
You're right.

03:55.820 --> 03:56.940
Worrying won't change anything.

03:57.820 --> 03:59.739
I should do something useful
to help him instead.

04:00.220 --> 04:01.820
It's been around a hundred days
since Mr. Zhao left the capital.

04:02.260 --> 04:03.459
The mourning period is over.

04:04.459 --> 04:05.980
It's time for you to step outside again,
Madam.

04:08.780 --> 04:09.780
Summon the managers

04:10.060 --> 04:11.980
of all Xie branches.

04:13.179 --> 04:14.179
Starting today,

04:14.419 --> 04:16.540
all grocery stores under Xie

04:16.780 --> 04:19.580
selling rice, flour, oil, tea, and salt

04:19.700 --> 04:21.460
will all switch to using
gold-weighted scales.

04:23.780 --> 04:25.059
Before Mr. Zhao left,

04:25.580 --> 04:26.660
we made a promise.

04:27.379 --> 04:28.619
We gave it three months.

04:30.619 --> 04:31.819
No matter whether

04:32.259 --> 04:34.379
he can bring back the evidence,

04:35.299 --> 04:37.660
I will expose the Yu family's lies

04:38.460 --> 04:39.980
and give the people the justice
they deserve.

04:41.560 --> 04:42.259
(Xie Rice and Flour Shop)

04:42.259 --> 04:43.100
Excuse me.

04:43.580 --> 04:44.179
What's going on?

04:44.179 --> 04:46.100
Why does the amount seem off today?

04:46.100 --> 04:47.140
Off?

04:47.340 --> 04:48.859
It seems like there's more than usual.

04:49.020 --> 04:49.980
That can't be.

04:49.980 --> 04:50.499
Let me weigh it for you.

04:50.499 --> 04:52.259
Mine was more than usual
the other day too.

04:52.540 --> 04:53.660
So was mine.

04:54.140 --> 04:54.700
That's right.

04:54.780 --> 04:55.819
Really?

04:55.819 --> 04:56.939
They're truly honest merchants.

04:57.100 --> 04:57.700
Look.

04:57.859 --> 04:58.980
Three catties. Exactly right.

04:59.179 --> 05:01.340
Could it be other shops have been
giving you less than you paid for?

05:01.340 --> 05:02.499
When it comes to the scales,

05:02.499 --> 05:03.580
we would never dare cheat.

05:03.819 --> 05:06.020
A merchant's scale is a measure
of our integrity.

05:06.299 --> 05:08.379
It is also the standard by which
the authorities ensure fairness.

05:08.619 --> 05:09.220
Good!

05:09.220 --> 05:10.580
This Xie Rice and Flour Shop

05:10.580 --> 05:11.540
is truly a fair and honest business.

05:12.100 --> 05:13.379
All of Xie's shops

05:13.379 --> 05:14.619
have switched to gold-weighted scales.

05:14.819 --> 05:16.540
After weighing every catty of goods,

05:16.540 --> 05:17.619
they always give a little extra.

05:18.140 --> 05:19.660
This woman

05:19.660 --> 05:21.580
is really troublesome.

05:22.259 --> 05:24.100
She can afford to keep losing money,

05:25.179 --> 05:26.540
but other businesses

05:26.540 --> 05:28.299
can't withstand the pressure.

05:28.859 --> 05:30.340
Ever since she changed the scales,

05:30.859 --> 05:32.540
our losses have been piling up.

05:35.660 --> 05:37.819
Xie's shops were the private property
my mother left me.

05:40.220 --> 05:41.980
I can't afford to worry
about losing this money.

05:43.419 --> 05:44.859
I have to make this as big as possible

05:45.499 --> 05:46.780
and drag the Yu family into it.

05:47.340 --> 05:48.340
If this continues, it may draw

05:48.340 --> 05:50.460
the attention of the Military
and the Market Administration Office.

05:50.619 --> 05:51.780
Given enough time,

05:51.780 --> 05:53.220
the people will start to believe

05:53.220 --> 05:55.020
that every shop except Xie

05:55.020 --> 05:56.580
has been shortchanging them.

05:56.700 --> 05:58.419
They'll be forced
to prove their own innocence.

05:59.419 --> 06:00.700
That's exactly what I want.

06:01.819 --> 06:03.499
The type of scale I use doesn't matter.

06:03.859 --> 06:05.020
What matters is letting the people know

06:05.140 --> 06:07.419
that there is another standard
of measure in this world.

06:08.220 --> 06:09.980
Whether I win or lose doesn't matter.

06:10.419 --> 06:11.619
What matters is letting them know

06:11.900 --> 06:13.939
that some people can keep winning
simply because they have power.

06:13.939 --> 06:14.739
That's what truly matters.

06:15.179 --> 06:16.619
But if this exposes

06:16.939 --> 06:19.020
the authorities hiding the gold weights,

06:20.100 --> 06:21.259
we'll be in trouble.

06:21.819 --> 06:24.379
She's using money to win over the people

06:24.499 --> 06:26.140
and build support for Zhao Ling.

06:26.220 --> 06:27.220
Zhao Ling?

06:27.939 --> 06:29.100
It has to be it.

06:29.379 --> 06:30.739
Zhao Ling must have gone after

06:30.739 --> 06:32.619
those gold weights.

06:32.780 --> 06:33.819
Once this matter

06:34.900 --> 06:36.499
comes to light,

06:37.619 --> 06:39.340
it will provoke public outrage.

06:39.660 --> 06:41.419
And the Yu family...

06:41.859 --> 06:43.499
Grand Secretary Yu understands
power better than anyone.

06:43.980 --> 06:45.020
What he fears most

06:45.540 --> 06:47.020
is that the people will eventually

06:47.259 --> 06:48.700
come to understand

06:49.059 --> 06:50.499
what power truly means.

06:50.700 --> 06:52.660
After all, they still have
no actual proof.

06:53.460 --> 06:55.140
She's using public opinion against me.

06:55.700 --> 06:56.980
When enough people repeat a lie,

06:56.980 --> 06:58.379
it can destroy anyone.

06:58.460 --> 06:59.739
Who needs a formal conviction then?

07:00.499 --> 07:01.700
What about Anzhou?

07:02.259 --> 07:03.540
By my estimate,

07:03.780 --> 07:05.220
whether it succeeds or fails,

07:05.700 --> 07:06.980
Mr. Zhao should be on his way
back by now.

07:07.939 --> 07:09.020
Send out more goods.

07:10.100 --> 07:11.299
I will do everything I can

07:11.379 --> 07:12.259
to build support for him.

07:12.739 --> 07:14.299
We're burning time.

07:15.379 --> 07:16.739
She's burning money.

07:19.140 --> 07:21.259
We'll see who gives in first.

07:23.020 --> 07:23.939
Give me a hand.

07:23.939 --> 07:24.580
Come on.

07:25.419 --> 07:26.100
Here, hand it to me.

07:29.739 --> 07:30.419
Put it down carefully.

07:30.419 --> 07:30.859
Okay.

07:34.419 --> 07:34.980
Wait.

07:36.619 --> 07:37.220
Open it.

07:38.859 --> 07:39.780
Move!

07:47.179 --> 07:48.179
What are you staring at?

07:48.179 --> 07:48.859
Open them all!

07:48.859 --> 07:49.460
Yes.

07:49.460 --> 07:50.340
Check them!

07:52.739 --> 07:53.619
I've looked into it.

07:53.819 --> 07:55.619
There was indeed a Jiuweijiao
in the Northwest in recent years.

07:55.619 --> 07:56.700
He built a very large business.

07:56.819 --> 07:57.580
He had

07:57.580 --> 07:59.379
a type of salt called Ground Snow
that was as pure as official salt.

07:59.379 --> 08:00.739
He even controlled the transport routes.

08:01.179 --> 08:02.460
He wore a mask at all times.

08:02.939 --> 08:04.460
Ordinary people had never seen his face.

08:04.780 --> 08:05.819
Everything matches.

08:07.419 --> 08:08.220
What happened after that?

08:08.580 --> 08:10.220
Later, for some reason,

08:10.379 --> 08:11.819
he joined the army in Ganlin.

08:13.900 --> 08:14.980
And after that?

08:15.059 --> 08:16.340
A few years later,

08:16.660 --> 08:17.980
he was transferred to the capital

08:17.980 --> 08:18.859
and became a court official.

08:18.939 --> 08:20.100
Do you know his surname?

08:20.660 --> 08:21.580
I think...

08:21.900 --> 08:22.700
his surname was Zhao.

08:24.059 --> 08:24.939
Ganlin.

08:25.499 --> 08:26.379
Joined the army.

08:26.580 --> 08:27.419
Court official.

08:27.739 --> 08:28.460
Surname Zhao.

08:29.259 --> 08:30.540
Could it be Zhao Ling,

08:30.540 --> 08:31.340
the one who was falsely accused

08:31.660 --> 08:32.539
and had his family ruined?

08:32.779 --> 08:33.259
Hurry!

08:33.619 --> 08:35.820
Send an urgent report
to the Grand Secretary!

08:35.820 --> 08:36.820
Hurry!

08:36.820 --> 08:37.300
Yes.

08:39.420 --> 08:40.659
(Xie Rice and Flour Shop)
The rice, oil, salt, and tea

08:40.659 --> 08:42.019
(Xie Rice and Flour Shop)
we've bought from Xie lately

08:42.019 --> 08:44.139
weigh more than what other shops
give us.

08:44.220 --> 08:45.019
Exactly.

08:45.300 --> 08:47.340
Xie insists that their scales
are accurate.

08:47.340 --> 08:49.220
Then what we bought
from other shops before

08:49.300 --> 08:50.180
must have been short-weighted!

08:50.180 --> 08:51.940
Don't you owe us an explanation?

08:51.940 --> 08:53.499
Give us an explanation!

08:53.499 --> 08:54.420
Give us an explanation!

08:54.420 --> 08:55.700
Our scales are absolutely accurate.

08:55.700 --> 08:56.700
Absolutely accurate.

08:57.100 --> 08:57.980
Our scales

08:57.980 --> 08:59.379
have all been inspected and approved
by the authorities.

08:59.379 --> 09:00.659
We've never shortchanged anyone.

09:00.820 --> 09:02.019
Who runs a business

09:02.019 --> 09:03.340
by losing money just to sell more?

09:03.340 --> 09:04.379
Wouldn't that disrupt the market?

09:04.379 --> 09:05.659
Move aside.

09:06.739 --> 09:07.300
Officer.

09:07.899 --> 09:08.420
Officer.

09:08.580 --> 09:09.539
(Xie Rice and Flour Shop)
You came just in time.

09:09.539 --> 09:10.580
(Xie Rice and Flour Shop)
Look at these people.

09:10.779 --> 09:11.940
Stop causing trouble.

09:11.940 --> 09:12.499
Officer,

09:12.779 --> 09:14.539
you can't just ignore this.

09:14.539 --> 09:16.019
Who has actually been shortchanging us?

09:16.019 --> 09:17.859
You officials owe us an answer.

09:17.859 --> 09:19.220
Exactly.

09:19.220 --> 09:20.940
Can't the authorities even tell

09:20.940 --> 09:21.980
how much one catty is?

09:21.980 --> 09:23.220
How many standards are there?

09:23.220 --> 09:24.300
How many different weights are there?

09:24.300 --> 09:25.340
Exactly!

09:25.460 --> 09:26.340
You need to take this

09:26.499 --> 09:27.619
to the Market Administration Office.

09:27.619 --> 09:29.060
Today, even if

09:29.139 --> 09:30.700
we get a few extra taels, that's fine.

09:31.100 --> 09:33.019
But what if one day the authorities
collect goods from us

09:33.220 --> 09:35.420
and claim they're short in weight?

09:35.420 --> 09:36.420
If this continues,

09:36.539 --> 09:38.139
how can there be any standard at all?

09:38.300 --> 09:39.060
Exactly.

09:39.060 --> 09:40.100
Tell me,

09:40.100 --> 09:41.259
could any official resist
the temptation?

09:42.100 --> 09:43.940
(Xie Jewelry Shop)
The pearl is worth ten thousand taels.

09:44.019 --> 09:46.100
No wonder the Yu family gives
such lavish gifts.

09:46.259 --> 09:47.619
They have a fortune

09:47.619 --> 09:48.739
backing them.

09:48.859 --> 09:50.180
Money seems to know where to go,

09:50.180 --> 09:51.580
straight into officials' pockets.

09:51.580 --> 09:52.379
Once it goes there,

09:52.379 --> 09:53.499
it never comes our way.

09:53.580 --> 09:54.700
What are they showing off for?

09:54.820 --> 09:56.139
Isn't that just proof
of how much they've taken?

09:59.340 --> 09:59.980
Master.

10:00.100 --> 10:01.019
An urgent report from Anzhou.

10:01.019 --> 10:02.940
Zhao Ling obtained the gold weights
from the Anzhou Prefecture Office

10:02.940 --> 10:04.340
and Shen Congsi's final letter.

10:04.859 --> 10:05.739
Why weren't you informed sooner

10:05.739 --> 10:06.899
about such a major matter?

10:07.220 --> 10:08.100
Forgive me, Master.

10:08.220 --> 10:09.659
It's all because Prefect Liu failed
in his duty.

10:09.659 --> 10:11.379
I calculated based on the date
the message was sent.

10:11.739 --> 10:13.100
Zhao Ling should be nearing Yuzhou.

10:13.180 --> 10:14.499
He'll arrive in the capital
within the next two days.

10:30.019 --> 10:30.859
Issue the order.

10:31.859 --> 10:33.300
At any cost,

10:33.300 --> 10:34.580
Zhao Ling must not

10:34.580 --> 10:35.899
return to the capital alive.

10:36.259 --> 10:36.899
Yes.

10:46.100 --> 10:50.019
I should have never killed Shen Congsi
in the first place.

10:51.100 --> 10:53.060
Stop Zhao Ling at all costs.

10:53.300 --> 10:54.779
He must not make it back
to the capital alive.

10:55.180 --> 10:55.659
Yes.

10:55.659 --> 10:57.539
Deploy men along the road
from Yuzhou to the capital.

10:57.619 --> 10:58.779
Make sure nothing goes wrong.

11:01.899 --> 11:02.619
Move. Hurry.

11:09.739 --> 11:10.859
I never thought

11:11.180 --> 11:12.739
General Zhao would still be alive.

11:12.859 --> 11:13.700
Madam Zhao

11:13.700 --> 11:14.899
won't have to live as a widow anymore.

11:16.180 --> 11:16.820
No.

11:17.259 --> 11:18.340
That's not the point.

11:18.659 --> 11:19.580
The real question

11:20.220 --> 11:21.980
is why the Yu family fears him so much.

11:22.580 --> 11:24.139
They even sent people to kill him
on the way.

11:27.300 --> 11:28.220
Could it be

11:29.259 --> 11:30.700
that General Zhao has evidence

11:30.779 --> 11:32.539
that could bring the Yu family down?

11:33.420 --> 11:34.539
If they fail,

11:34.820 --> 11:36.259
the Yu family will face disaster.

11:37.019 --> 11:37.700
Cairong.

11:37.899 --> 11:38.980
Go pack our belongings.

11:38.980 --> 11:39.859
My Lady.

11:39.859 --> 11:41.019
I've already prepared everything.

11:47.060 --> 11:48.019
I exchanged

11:48.019 --> 11:49.180
all the valuable jewelry
for silver notes.

11:49.259 --> 11:50.460
I've sewn them into the belt.

11:50.460 --> 11:51.580
There are several hundred taels
in there.

11:51.980 --> 11:53.259
And I've prepared some silver pieces
as well,

11:53.259 --> 11:54.100
for expenses on the road.

11:54.340 --> 11:55.100
Well done.

11:55.859 --> 11:56.379
Hurry.

11:56.379 --> 11:57.259
Tie this on.

12:13.340 --> 12:14.340
Where are you going?

12:16.460 --> 12:17.779
We're going to the estate

12:17.779 --> 12:19.340
to deliver some embroidery
to Young Madam.

12:23.340 --> 12:24.180
Do you

12:24.180 --> 12:25.100
want to see them?

12:25.100 --> 12:25.619
No need.

12:37.980 --> 12:38.940
If you have time,

12:39.980 --> 12:41.539
could you go to Xie's for me?

12:47.899 --> 12:48.859
I understand.

13:01.700 --> 13:02.499
Young Master.

13:03.460 --> 13:04.700
Instead of worrying about that,

13:04.940 --> 13:06.379
you should think more
about Young Master Ji.

13:07.180 --> 13:08.700
Spend more time with him
these next few days.

13:09.340 --> 13:10.700
After what happened before,

13:10.940 --> 13:12.340
even if I went to Xie's,

13:12.539 --> 13:14.220
Fu Tingyun wouldn't see me.

13:15.779 --> 13:17.340
How dare you call her by her name?

13:20.659 --> 13:21.899
Then what should I call her?

13:22.180 --> 13:22.899
My ancestor?

13:23.379 --> 13:24.060
A goddess?

13:24.820 --> 13:26.139
What nonsense are you talking about?

13:28.739 --> 13:29.739
I'll take my leave, Young Master.

13:47.840 --> 13:51.460
(Yu Residence)

13:54.920 --> 13:56.600
(Yu Residence)

14:00.850 --> 14:02.140
(Funeral Eulogy by Fu Tingyun for My Late Husband, Zhao Ling)

14:03.139 --> 14:03.940
Madam.

14:04.300 --> 14:05.340
Concubine Wu is here.

14:13.859 --> 14:14.820
What brings you here?

14:15.940 --> 14:17.180
Madam, your performance

14:17.379 --> 14:18.539
has been quite convincing.

14:26.619 --> 14:27.700
What do you mean?

14:27.859 --> 14:29.019
Exactly what I said.

14:37.859 --> 14:38.619
Please take a seat.

14:44.060 --> 14:44.820
Madam.

14:45.379 --> 14:46.779
I not only know

14:46.899 --> 14:48.180
that General Zhao is still alive,

14:48.940 --> 14:49.859
but I also know

14:50.180 --> 14:51.659
that he has obtained

14:51.659 --> 14:53.340
evidence that could destroy
the Yu family.

14:54.220 --> 14:55.100
But now,

14:55.420 --> 14:56.779
Grand Secretary Yu has ordered

14:57.340 --> 14:59.139
that General Zhao be killed

14:59.340 --> 15:00.779
at all costs

15:00.779 --> 15:01.739
before he returns to the capital.

15:02.499 --> 15:04.100
He has already reached Yuzhou.

15:04.300 --> 15:05.980
He'll arrive in the capital
within two days.

15:06.739 --> 15:07.499
Madam,

15:07.980 --> 15:09.499
you don't have much time left.

15:11.259 --> 15:12.220
What do you want?

15:13.300 --> 15:14.340
I wonder if you

15:14.619 --> 15:15.940
still remember

15:16.659 --> 15:18.700
that I once asked you
for a new household register.

15:19.019 --> 15:20.379
The time has come.

15:20.779 --> 15:22.539
I want to leave the Yu family for good.

15:22.779 --> 15:24.220
I need your help.

15:25.619 --> 15:27.340
You want me to win

15:28.100 --> 15:29.220
because you're afraid

15:29.220 --> 15:30.420
the Yu family won't be ruined completely

15:30.619 --> 15:31.859
and will still have the power
to come after you.

15:32.820 --> 15:33.580
Exactly.

15:40.820 --> 15:41.899
I'll prepare

15:42.539 --> 15:43.859
what you need.

15:44.460 --> 15:46.139
You won't survive on your own.

15:47.100 --> 15:48.899
After things calm down in a couple
of years,

15:49.619 --> 15:51.180
you can stay at one of Xie's branches

15:51.300 --> 15:52.259
and become a manager.

15:52.739 --> 15:54.060
At least you'll have somewhere
to rely on.

15:58.180 --> 15:59.180
Thank you, Madam.

16:02.820 --> 16:03.499
Thank you.

16:09.340 --> 16:10.180
Madam.

16:11.340 --> 16:12.499
I came here today

16:12.619 --> 16:13.820
without prior notice,

16:15.180 --> 16:16.580
to ask something difficult of you.

16:16.940 --> 16:18.340
I hope you can lend us a hand.

16:18.539 --> 16:19.220
As long as the Wang family

16:19.220 --> 16:20.940
can shield you from some of the trouble,

16:21.580 --> 16:22.739
just tell me what you need.

16:26.460 --> 16:28.379
Zhao Ling is already on his way
back to the capital.

16:29.460 --> 16:30.300
Zhao Ling?

16:30.779 --> 16:31.700
He has

16:31.859 --> 16:33.379
the key evidence in his hands.

16:34.100 --> 16:35.739
But the road ahead is filled
with danger.

16:36.940 --> 16:37.779
I beg you, Madam,

16:37.859 --> 16:39.259
to help him through the final stretch

16:39.259 --> 16:40.499
and ensure he reaches
the capital safely.

16:41.379 --> 16:42.139
Zhao Ling

16:42.820 --> 16:43.739
is still alive?

16:47.899 --> 16:50.139
A border general mobilizing troops
is strictly forbidden.

16:56.739 --> 16:57.619
Commander Wang.

16:57.980 --> 16:58.779
If Zhao Ling

16:58.779 --> 16:59.899
falls before reaching the capital,

17:00.539 --> 17:02.220
the Yu faction will escape unscathed

17:02.300 --> 17:03.379
and go free.

17:04.180 --> 17:04.940
By then,

17:05.259 --> 17:06.380
all the efforts

17:06.660 --> 17:07.940
will have been wasted.

17:08.180 --> 17:09.259
And countless injustices

17:09.339 --> 17:10.579
will remain buried forever.

17:11.339 --> 17:12.299
Things

17:12.860 --> 17:14.499
have reached a critical point.

17:17.420 --> 17:18.739
Please rise and speak.

17:27.900 --> 17:28.579
My Lord.

17:29.499 --> 17:31.059
We can't just stand by
and watch him die.

17:31.980 --> 17:33.779
It's not that I would stand by
and watch him die.

17:34.620 --> 17:35.420
It's just that

17:35.420 --> 17:37.099
this is not a decision I can make alone.

17:37.380 --> 17:39.140
Whether we can help Zhao Ling

17:39.579 --> 17:41.579
depends on whether the soldiers
in the Northwest

17:41.700 --> 17:43.259
are willing to help him.

17:44.739 --> 17:46.499
I will explain the situation to them.

17:46.980 --> 17:49.739
But I cannot order them to do so.

17:55.900 --> 17:57.460
If he cannot make it back to court,

17:59.900 --> 18:01.420
then it is simply fate.

18:03.339 --> 18:04.980
I would never blame

18:04.980 --> 18:06.579
the people of the Northwest for it.

18:15.980 --> 18:16.980
What is this?

18:17.660 --> 18:18.339
Mr. Jin,

18:18.339 --> 18:19.420
these are local specialties

18:19.420 --> 18:20.420
sent from the Huaying shop.

18:20.700 --> 18:21.579
It's not even a holiday.

18:21.579 --> 18:22.660
Why would they send me a gift?

18:35.339 --> 18:37.019
It says ten catties here.

18:37.420 --> 18:38.940
But there are at least
14 catties inside.

18:43.819 --> 18:45.059
Who told you to bring this?

18:45.739 --> 18:46.460
Well...

18:46.860 --> 18:47.660
Speak.

18:57.940 --> 18:59.339
Madam Zhao sent you here?

18:59.739 --> 19:00.660
Quanhui said

19:00.739 --> 19:02.380
she wants to build support
for Mr. Zhao's return to the capital.

19:02.940 --> 19:04.380
She asks if you'll repent

19:04.539 --> 19:05.299
and help her.

19:07.380 --> 19:08.339
Mr. Zhao

19:09.700 --> 19:10.660
is returning to the capital?

19:12.380 --> 19:13.420
He is alive?

19:15.620 --> 19:16.539
She said

19:17.259 --> 19:18.980
that you cut off one of your ears
in Yongning Prefecture.

19:19.339 --> 19:20.220
She has never forgotten that.

19:20.940 --> 19:22.019
And she believes

19:22.700 --> 19:23.980
that you want this chance.

19:31.499 --> 19:32.700
It's fine if you don't help.

19:33.299 --> 19:34.460
We'll find another way.

19:44.380 --> 19:45.539
Mr. Zhao is alive.

19:51.900 --> 19:53.499
Mr. Zhao is alive.

20:19.059 --> 20:20.700
I, Jin Yuanbao,

20:21.019 --> 20:23.460
hereby accuse Grand Secretary Yu Guodong

20:23.739 --> 20:25.460
of framing a loyal official!

20:26.220 --> 20:27.940
I, Jin Yuanbao, confess my crimes.

20:28.339 --> 20:30.380
I falsely accused General Zhaoyong,
Zhao Ling.

20:30.380 --> 20:31.380
(Discern Every Detail, Uphold Justice,
Upright Law, Peaceful People.)

20:32.539 --> 20:33.420
For years,

20:33.579 --> 20:35.259
Grand Secretary Yu used
the gold counterweight

20:35.739 --> 20:37.059
to manipulate measurements.

20:38.220 --> 20:39.339
When we salt merchants

20:40.019 --> 20:41.779
delivered grain and supplies,

20:42.019 --> 20:44.180
we were forced to provide one catty and
seven taels for every catty required.

20:44.620 --> 20:45.660
No merchant is entirely honest.

20:46.460 --> 20:47.779
To make up for the losses,

20:48.660 --> 20:49.980
we

20:50.140 --> 20:51.620
had no choice but to pass off
inferior goods as quality ones,

20:51.620 --> 20:52.660
hoard salt and drive up prices,

20:52.660 --> 20:53.140
causing

20:53.380 --> 20:54.739
prices to soar.

20:54.980 --> 20:55.980
When the salt reform was introduced,

20:56.099 --> 20:57.420
to adapt to the new policy,

20:57.539 --> 20:58.700
I sought refuge with Grand Secretary Yu.

20:59.299 --> 21:00.700
Under his orders,

21:00.980 --> 21:02.140
I forged evidence

21:02.339 --> 21:03.579
to frame General Zhao.

21:03.660 --> 21:05.700
Those who falsely accuse others
of crimes punishable by death

21:06.180 --> 21:06.660
shall receive

21:06.660 --> 21:07.660
eighty strokes.

21:07.980 --> 21:08.660
Do you

21:08.819 --> 21:09.739
confess your crimes?

21:11.819 --> 21:12.620
I confess.

21:13.980 --> 21:14.539
Strike!

21:14.540 --> 21:15.540
(Token)

21:15.540 --> 21:16.540
(Justice Mirrors All)

21:22.700 --> 21:23.539
Will you

21:24.019 --> 21:25.339
change your statement?

21:25.339 --> 21:28.299
Never.

21:48.180 --> 21:49.739
Isn't he that salt merchant?

21:49.739 --> 21:50.499
He always seemed

21:50.499 --> 21:51.739
to live quite a lavish life.

21:51.739 --> 21:52.819
After eighty strokes,

21:52.819 --> 21:54.140
he didn't even make a sound.

21:54.140 --> 21:55.620
Grand Secretary Yu is truly ruthless.

21:55.700 --> 21:57.739
No wonder he was always giving away
such gifts, like that luminous pearl.

21:57.980 --> 21:59.099
(Convict Jin Yuanbao. Signed and marked)
Turns out his wealth

21:59.099 --> 22:00.420
(Convict Jin Yuanbao. Signed and marked)
was all taken from the people.

23:11.499 --> 23:12.620
I never thought

23:12.779 --> 23:14.460
that during all these days I've been
staying at the estate,

23:15.660 --> 23:17.420
you would be the first to come see me.

23:20.019 --> 23:21.860
I only hope I'll be the last one.

23:25.299 --> 23:26.779
The Yu family
is on the brink of collapse.

23:26.980 --> 23:28.220
They are barely holding on.

23:29.180 --> 23:29.980
Yake,

23:30.779 --> 23:32.259
if you want to survive,

23:33.339 --> 23:34.140
you should leave.

23:40.019 --> 23:41.579
You went through all this trouble

23:42.940 --> 23:44.539
just to warn me.

23:46.539 --> 23:47.739
If it were anyone else,

23:49.380 --> 23:51.180
I might have believed
it was out of friendship.

23:51.539 --> 23:52.299
But you've always been

23:53.259 --> 23:54.739
a master strategist,

23:55.980 --> 23:57.059
always planning several steps ahead.

24:00.420 --> 24:01.220
Tingyun,

24:02.499 --> 24:03.579
what do you want?

24:06.220 --> 24:07.420
I came here today

24:08.900 --> 24:09.980
to warn you,

24:11.779 --> 24:13.539
but I also have my own motives.

24:17.099 --> 24:18.220
If you have

24:18.299 --> 24:19.900
any evidence of the Yu family's crimes,

24:21.220 --> 24:22.059
give it to me.

24:23.819 --> 24:24.700
Then,

24:25.579 --> 24:26.900
I may be able

24:27.220 --> 24:28.259
to secure a way out

24:28.739 --> 24:29.980
for you and Ji.

24:34.499 --> 24:35.940
The Yu family has committed
countless crimes.

24:37.700 --> 24:38.900
Whether I live or die

24:40.019 --> 24:41.180
is up to fate.

24:42.299 --> 24:43.860
It no longer matters.

24:46.940 --> 24:47.980
What about Ji?

24:48.220 --> 24:49.380
He is innocent.

24:50.499 --> 24:51.700
He's still in the residence.

24:52.819 --> 24:54.739
Everyone says you are heartless.

24:56.980 --> 24:57.940
But I know

24:59.099 --> 25:00.380
no mother

25:00.620 --> 25:01.980
could ever stop loving her child.

25:07.140 --> 25:07.980
I knew it.

25:09.700 --> 25:11.259
You are still trying to use him
to pressure me.

25:13.819 --> 25:14.660
Of course.

25:17.339 --> 25:18.900
Back then, I grew close to you

25:18.900 --> 25:20.420
because you shone so brightly,

25:22.019 --> 25:23.460
while I had nothing.

25:25.819 --> 25:27.940
I only wanted to borrow
a little warmth from your light.

25:29.499 --> 25:30.779
If this friendship

25:33.339 --> 25:35.700
was built on a swamp of schemes
from the very beginning,

25:37.099 --> 25:38.460
then the flowers it blooms

25:41.499 --> 25:43.259
could hardly retain any fragrance.

25:45.420 --> 25:46.980
Now I am lost in the fog,

25:49.140 --> 25:50.299
and I can no longer see clearly.

25:51.259 --> 25:52.980
Why should I force anything from you?

25:54.180 --> 25:55.660
There was a time

25:56.700 --> 25:58.660
when I considered you a true friend,
like family.

25:59.779 --> 26:01.539
I once shared with you

26:02.579 --> 26:04.220
many secrets between us.

26:06.779 --> 26:07.860
The first

26:07.940 --> 26:09.339
joys and sorrows of my life...

26:09.739 --> 26:11.420
I shared with you were always sincere.

26:13.940 --> 26:15.099
But later,

26:17.499 --> 26:18.779
we both grew up.

26:20.180 --> 26:21.579
And everything changed.

26:23.779 --> 26:25.019
I did not come here today

26:25.620 --> 26:26.860
to reminisce about the past,

26:27.700 --> 26:28.940
nor to seek reconciliation.

26:29.460 --> 26:30.539
I came only to give you

26:30.980 --> 26:31.980
and Ji

26:32.700 --> 26:34.460
a chance to survive.

26:35.579 --> 26:36.620
I have already shown

26:37.779 --> 26:39.059
you a way out.

26:39.460 --> 26:40.620
Whether you believe me
or not is up to you.

26:46.499 --> 26:47.579
Since you are here,

26:49.339 --> 26:51.099
take this chest of my poems with you.

26:53.700 --> 26:54.940
It's almost laughable.

26:57.259 --> 26:58.739
I once prided myself on my talent,

27:00.499 --> 27:02.259
yet I was confined within this secluded
household.

27:04.940 --> 27:06.180
This chest of poems

27:07.620 --> 27:10.019
is all I can offer to honor the bond
we once shared.

27:11.059 --> 27:12.660
I hope you will put them to good use

27:13.259 --> 27:14.819
and let them see the light of day,

27:15.660 --> 27:16.779
rather than remain buried in dust.

27:19.940 --> 27:21.620
Are you truly not going to reconsider?

27:22.420 --> 27:23.739
Wasn't it you who said

27:25.099 --> 27:26.380
that whether you believe

27:26.499 --> 27:27.660
or choose

27:28.259 --> 27:29.660
all depends on a single thought?

27:30.140 --> 27:31.180
Doesn't that apply

27:32.620 --> 27:34.339
to you as well?

27:35.220 --> 27:36.299
Or is it that

27:37.739 --> 27:39.180
without something to gain,

27:42.099 --> 27:44.259
you would not even accept my poems?

28:32.520 --> 28:35.560
(Dongshan Poetry Talks)

28:35.560 --> 28:37.960
(Yu Residence Gift Record)

28:40.059 --> 28:40.779
This...

28:41.499 --> 28:42.860
This is the Yu family's

28:43.099 --> 28:44.779
record of social dealings.

28:45.760 --> 28:47.660
(Yu Residence Gift Ledger
Winter, the Sixth Year of Hongzhi)

28:48.220 --> 28:49.201
(Hanlin Scholar's Gift List)
This only records

28:49.420 --> 28:50.420
the inner residence's

28:50.420 --> 28:51.980
guest lists for banquets.

28:53.700 --> 28:54.900
Not just that.

28:59.259 --> 29:00.579
With this list,

29:02.739 --> 29:04.220
we can identify the members
of the Yu faction.

29:06.160 --> 29:08.440
♪Once a bird in a cage♪
(Lidu Prefecture Advisor)

29:08.440 --> 29:12.010
♪Longing for the boundless sky♪

29:12.768 --> 29:18.360
♪To break through a thousand barriers
and cast off a life of illusion♪

29:18.940 --> 29:20.339
So that's how it is.

29:26.180 --> 29:29.180
If I had not clung to this ridiculous
old affection,

29:31.019 --> 29:33.339
and looked through the poems
she gave me,

29:35.259 --> 29:36.299
this evidence

29:37.819 --> 29:40.220
would have remained buried
forever among old papers.

29:43.019 --> 29:45.420
But what if I had not held
on to those old feelings?

29:46.259 --> 29:48.099
What if I had thrown them away
without a second thought?

29:51.460 --> 29:56.304
♪May all common folk share one roof,
every lantern rest in peace♪

29:56.700 --> 29:58.620
Who wants her schemes?

29:59.900 --> 30:02.380
Who wants her charity?

30:04.180 --> 30:05.059
Enough.

30:05.180 --> 30:05.860
Hey.

30:10.020 --> 30:12.272
♪Let the past remain beyond recall♪

30:12.960 --> 30:16.768
♪Trade it for boundless blue skies
to fly free and far♪

30:17.800 --> 30:20.600
♪I seek no mercy lent by mortal world♪

30:20.860 --> 30:21.700
Father.

30:24.180 --> 30:28.464
♪I seek nothing beyond the world♪

30:29.700 --> 30:34.944
♪Let this fleeting world carry me
through a life adrift♪

30:36.499 --> 30:37.380
Ji.

30:39.900 --> 30:41.499
This is all I can do

30:43.499 --> 30:44.900
for you.

30:44.976 --> 30:48.960
♪May it buy the world
one moment's peace from the storm♪

30:49.780 --> 30:54.144
♪I crave no clarity
from outside my soul♪

30:56.100 --> 31:00.304
♪I crave no clarity♪

31:01.500 --> 31:02.928
♪from outside my soul♪

31:03.460 --> 31:05.220
Wei Donglin is such a fool.

31:05.860 --> 31:08.620
His Majesty
clearly let a threat slip away.

31:08.819 --> 31:10.420
He is waiting for the right moment

31:10.620 --> 31:11.620
to wipe out

31:11.620 --> 31:12.860
the entire Yu faction in one stroke.

31:13.620 --> 31:15.700
Yet he remains completely unaware.

31:16.380 --> 31:18.180
He thinks that with Zhao Ling gone,

31:18.620 --> 31:19.660
this court

31:19.660 --> 31:20.380
would be

31:20.380 --> 31:22.460
entirely under Grand Secretary
Yu's control.

31:24.460 --> 31:26.460
Fortunately, I was quick to act

31:26.739 --> 31:29.779
and removed these promotion records
in time.

31:34.739 --> 31:35.860
It's

31:36.059 --> 31:37.420
up to you

31:37.420 --> 31:38.299
whether

31:38.860 --> 31:39.460
to protect him

31:39.460 --> 31:40.539
or not.

31:43.099 --> 31:44.099
I can't help it.

31:44.700 --> 31:45.499
I

31:45.940 --> 31:47.220
just like him.

31:47.460 --> 31:49.180
Keeping a dog is fine,

31:49.860 --> 31:50.620
but

31:50.940 --> 31:52.819
never forget to keep it on a leash.

31:58.380 --> 31:59.900
With this,

32:00.539 --> 32:02.019
no matter where this man

32:02.019 --> 32:03.380
climbs to in the future,

32:03.739 --> 32:05.900
even if he surpasses me someday,

32:05.900 --> 32:08.059
you can still bring him down.

32:08.700 --> 32:10.620
This is the last thing

32:10.779 --> 32:12.660
I leave for you.

32:12.779 --> 32:14.380
Keep it safe.

32:14.700 --> 32:17.019
Do not let him deceive you
into giving it away.

32:23.420 --> 32:24.460
Rest assured, Father.

32:25.059 --> 32:26.140
I will remember.

32:27.760 --> 32:31.040
(Liu Shulin, Ministry of Personnel
Zhao Shiqing, Ministry of Revenue)

34:18.179 --> 34:19.900
The Northwest Army is here.

34:24.860 --> 34:26.340
Though I'm old,

34:26.460 --> 34:28.099
can I still fight?

34:29.340 --> 34:30.300
Thank you, Commander Wang.

34:30.860 --> 34:32.539
A frontier general privately mobilizing
troops is a grave offense.

34:32.740 --> 34:33.900
But your loyalty,

34:34.619 --> 34:35.659
I, Zhao Ling, will never forget.

34:36.699 --> 34:38.780
General Zhao, you risked your life
for the Northwest for years.

34:39.219 --> 34:40.900
Today, the Northwest Army
will protect you.

34:40.980 --> 34:41.900
It is only right.

34:42.380 --> 34:43.820
What you have done for the Northwest,

34:44.099 --> 34:45.539
the brothers here all remember.

34:46.219 --> 34:47.139
Today,

34:47.619 --> 34:49.659
it is our turn to see you safely home.

34:59.340 --> 34:59.900
Look.

35:19.619 --> 35:20.820
They're back.

35:33.860 --> 35:35.260
After this rain,

35:36.380 --> 35:37.780
the sun should finally shine again.

35:41.820 --> 35:42.900
I, Zhao Ling,

35:43.019 --> 35:44.099
was ordered by Your Majesty
to investigate

35:44.179 --> 35:45.579
the case
of the Anzhou Imperial Salt Censor

35:45.579 --> 35:47.099
Shen Congsi's wrongful death.

35:47.740 --> 35:49.019
Today, I return to court!

35:49.659 --> 35:51.499
Lay down your armor
and enter the palace!

36:17.860 --> 36:18.820
I, Zhao Ling,

36:20.139 --> 36:21.139
pay my respects to Your Majesty.

36:21.539 --> 36:22.179
Rise.

36:23.059 --> 36:24.260
You all should know

36:24.380 --> 36:26.460
that Zhao Ling acted
under my secret decree

36:26.460 --> 36:27.980
to thoroughly investigate
the wrongful death of Shen Congsi,

36:27.980 --> 36:29.300
the Anzhou Imperial Salt Censor.

36:30.219 --> 36:30.860
Huchen.

36:31.059 --> 36:32.659
Present the evidence

36:32.780 --> 36:33.940
you have gathered.

36:36.019 --> 36:36.579
I was

36:36.579 --> 36:37.460
ordered to investigate this case.

36:37.780 --> 36:38.900
(Shen Congsi)
At Xie's in Anzhou,

36:38.980 --> 36:40.179
I found this final letter.

36:41.179 --> 36:42.940
It was written by Lord Shen himself.

36:43.300 --> 36:44.260
The words within

36:44.340 --> 36:45.260
are deeply moving.

36:45.579 --> 36:46.460
Please allow me

36:47.019 --> 36:47.980
to read it aloud.

36:48.619 --> 36:49.179
Granted.

36:51.820 --> 36:54.300
(Revere Heaven and Honor the Ancestors)

36:55.980 --> 36:57.300
But I have already alarmed them.

36:57.539 --> 36:58.579
I fear I will not survive.

36:59.139 --> 36:59.740
Yet,

37:00.099 --> 37:01.420
to plead for the people's cause,

37:01.659 --> 37:02.940
even death is without regret.

37:03.740 --> 37:05.300
If anyone should read this letter,

37:05.539 --> 37:06.940
may they carry on

37:07.019 --> 37:08.260
and see it through.

37:08.820 --> 37:11.219
Heaven has laid out countless paths
for all living beings,

37:12.940 --> 37:14.499
yet I alone walk the path of Asura.

37:14.944 --> 37:17.152
(Written by Shen Congsi)

37:29.499 --> 37:30.099
Your Majesty.

37:31.219 --> 37:32.219
There is one more matter.

37:39.499 --> 37:40.900
This is a standard weight.

37:41.699 --> 37:42.699
It bears no seal or marking.

37:44.380 --> 37:45.499
But this one

37:47.539 --> 37:49.699
bears the official seal
of Anzhou Prefecture.

37:51.980 --> 37:53.380
(Revere Heaven and Honor the Ancestors)

37:54.740 --> 37:56.460
This was done by the authorities.

37:58.420 --> 37:58.860
This...

38:27.980 --> 38:29.659
This weight is made of iron wrapped
in copper.

38:29.780 --> 38:31.619
For every catty and seven taels
of grain the salt merchants paid,

38:31.820 --> 38:33.219
the authorities recorded only one catty.

38:33.780 --> 38:34.780
Over the years,

38:35.460 --> 38:36.780
the embezzled amount
became immeasurable.

38:39.019 --> 38:40.940
Furthermore, Lord Shen stated
in his letter

38:41.380 --> 38:42.499
that the grain loss issue

38:42.900 --> 38:44.099
was connected to Grand Secretary Yu.

38:44.740 --> 38:46.099
And now, this golden weight

38:46.340 --> 38:47.340
also

38:47.900 --> 38:49.099
points to Grand Secretary Yu.

38:53.499 --> 38:54.420
Grand Secretary Yu.

38:55.820 --> 38:56.579
Do you

38:56.780 --> 38:58.019
have anything to say?

38:58.380 --> 38:59.019
Your Majesty,

38:59.499 --> 39:01.260
these are all false accusations
and framing.

39:01.579 --> 39:03.099
Everything General Zhao has said

39:03.099 --> 39:04.699
has nothing to do with me.

39:05.300 --> 39:08.139
Please allow me some time to refute
each accusation.

39:08.340 --> 39:09.300
Before that,

39:09.980 --> 39:12.179
I would like to ask
Commander Wang first.

39:13.579 --> 39:14.499
The Northwest Army

39:15.099 --> 39:16.619
belongs to the imperial court.

39:17.059 --> 39:19.019
What punishment should one face
for mobilizing troops without a decree?

39:19.740 --> 39:20.499
Commander Wang.

39:21.059 --> 39:22.139
Are the Northwest Army

39:22.740 --> 39:24.300
your troops,

39:24.780 --> 39:26.579
or His Majesty's?

39:32.659 --> 39:33.380
Your Majesty,

39:33.579 --> 39:34.460
I am guilty.

39:34.860 --> 39:36.539
I accept whatever punishment
Your Majesty deems fit.

39:37.099 --> 39:38.460
But I ask Your Majesty to see clearly.

39:38.780 --> 39:40.619
There was indeed injustice in the case
of Mo Yi.

39:40.980 --> 39:42.659
I stake my life on this.

39:42.659 --> 39:43.219
Mo Yi

39:43.219 --> 39:45.260
was never a corrupt official.

39:45.579 --> 39:46.539
I believe

39:46.539 --> 39:47.340
this case

39:47.619 --> 39:49.900
must also be connected
to Grand Secretary Yu.

39:51.099 --> 39:53.019
I ask Your Majesty
to investigate thoroughly.

39:54.059 --> 39:56.059
General Zhao, you think you can rely

39:56.179 --> 39:57.579
on a single weight to pin

39:57.579 --> 39:58.780
these baseless crimes on me?

39:59.740 --> 40:01.420
What if there is more
than one golden weight?

40:05.420 --> 40:06.019
Your Majesty,

40:06.340 --> 40:07.659
I was ordered to investigate

40:07.659 --> 40:08.659
the golden weight case.

40:08.860 --> 40:09.820
In Minzhou,

40:09.820 --> 40:11.019
I recovered crucial evidence

40:11.019 --> 40:12.059
and have come to report!

40:12.219 --> 40:12.820
I

40:12.820 --> 40:14.139
have brought back
the golden weight from Yuzhou

40:14.139 --> 40:15.099
and have come to report!

40:15.340 --> 40:15.980
I

40:15.980 --> 40:17.219
have brought back the golden weight
from Qianzhou

40:17.219 --> 40:18.139
and have come to report!

40:18.260 --> 40:18.900
I

40:18.900 --> 40:20.059
have brought back
the golden weight from Langzhou

40:20.059 --> 40:21.059
and have come to report!

40:22.460 --> 40:23.260
Rise.

40:26.219 --> 40:26.740
I

40:26.740 --> 40:27.780
impeach Grand Secretary Yu

40:27.780 --> 40:28.780
for embezzling salt tax revenues.

40:29.340 --> 40:31.699
After Salt Transport Commissioner Yan
of Yongning was brought to justice,

40:31.900 --> 40:33.619
he colluded with his successor,

40:33.940 --> 40:35.460
continued illegally selling
salt permits,

40:35.460 --> 40:36.420
and embezzled state taxes.

40:36.900 --> 40:38.539
Even the confiscated property
of the Yan family

40:38.539 --> 40:39.579
was taken for personal gain.

40:39.900 --> 40:42.019
He also used these iron weights
wrapped in copper

40:42.380 --> 40:44.380
to embezzle countless amounts
of salt tax over the years.

40:45.099 --> 40:46.460
Even more outrageous,

40:46.900 --> 40:48.340
to conceal his crimes,

40:48.619 --> 40:50.980
he even poisoned
Imperial Salt Censor Shen Congsi.

40:51.900 --> 40:53.179
I impeach Grand Secretary Yu

40:53.179 --> 40:54.380
for embezzling military provisions

40:54.539 --> 40:56.499
and colluding with Li Mao,
the Gandu Circuit Military Advisor,

40:56.499 --> 40:57.900
to act together in corruption.

40:58.019 --> 40:59.179
During the transport of grain shipments,

40:59.260 --> 41:00.659
he falsified losses,

41:00.659 --> 41:01.780
mixed sand and water into the grain,

41:01.780 --> 41:02.780
and resold military provisions.

41:03.019 --> 41:03.900
After the crime was exposed,

41:04.059 --> 41:06.300
he forced Li Mao to his death
and framed Mo Yi,

41:06.300 --> 41:08.139
silencing them both.

41:09.019 --> 41:09.619
I

41:09.619 --> 41:11.460
impeach Grand Secretary Yu
for framing loyal officials,

41:11.820 --> 41:13.139
for ordering the salt merchant

41:13.260 --> 41:14.139
Jin Yuanbao

41:14.139 --> 41:15.340
to falsely accuse Zhao Ling.

41:15.340 --> 41:16.780
I impeach Grand Secretary Yu

41:16.780 --> 41:18.099
for forming factions
and pursuing personal gain.

41:18.380 --> 41:19.619
Among the Six Ministries
and Nine Chief Ministers,

41:19.699 --> 41:21.380
half are his followers.

41:21.380 --> 41:22.460
I impeach Grand Secretary Yu

41:22.460 --> 41:23.380
for corrupting the salt administration,

41:23.380 --> 41:25.380
using salt reform as a pretext

41:25.380 --> 41:26.659
to fill his own coffers.

41:27.340 --> 41:28.539
I impeach Grand Secretary Yu,

41:28.699 --> 41:29.900
for his own personal gain,

41:30.179 --> 41:31.579
ordering Fifth Master Fu

41:31.579 --> 41:33.300
to poison his wife Xie,

41:33.619 --> 41:35.699
and forcing me to step down
in the name of filial duty.

41:36.139 --> 41:38.260
Such a parasite who harms
the nation and its people,

41:38.820 --> 41:40.460
if he is not executed,
how can the court's order be restored?

41:40.460 --> 41:41.300
If he is not beheaded,

41:41.579 --> 41:43.139
how can the people's anger be appeased?

41:43.820 --> 41:45.699
Seconded.

41:45.740 --> 41:47.860
Seconded.

41:48.499 --> 41:49.179
Furthermore,

41:50.059 --> 41:51.420
Master Zhenghe

41:52.059 --> 41:54.219
has brought a list of Grand Secretary
Yu's faction members.

41:55.059 --> 41:55.780
Summon

41:55.900 --> 41:58.579
Master Zhenghe to court.

42:09.969 --> 42:12.800
(Received rare books from Lord Cheng
to be returned with cloth as gifts)

42:20.139 --> 42:21.300
Grand Secretary Yu,

42:22.099 --> 42:24.059
you and your accomplices divided
the spoils among yourselves,

42:24.619 --> 42:26.380
thinking your power was deeply rooted.

42:27.499 --> 42:28.460
But I'm afraid

42:29.900 --> 42:31.380
greed will eventually lose to anger.

42:33.900 --> 42:36.460
As long as one person points a sword
at you,

42:37.780 --> 42:38.619
the people's fury

42:40.340 --> 42:43.099
will become thousands
of blades turned against you.

42:51.260 --> 42:53.340
Your Majesty, please see the truth.

42:53.659 --> 42:56.699
I have always sought only to ease
Your Majesty's burdens

42:56.699 --> 42:58.340
and relieve the treasury's troubles.

42:58.499 --> 43:00.539
That is why I have ended up today

43:00.539 --> 43:02.940
surrounded and attacked by everyone
in court.

43:03.179 --> 43:05.699
Yet my loyalty remains true.

43:06.420 --> 43:10.579
Knowing this would offend
the newly risen officials,

43:10.860 --> 43:12.940
I still did it for the sake
of the realm.

43:12.940 --> 43:14.980
I persisted despite all opposition,

43:15.059 --> 43:18.099
only to become the target

43:18.099 --> 43:20.099
of everyone's condemnation.

43:20.780 --> 43:23.820
Your Majesty, please judge fairly.

43:28.619 --> 43:29.420
Grand Secretary,

43:30.340 --> 43:30.980
I also

43:31.579 --> 43:32.860
entrusted you

43:32.860 --> 43:34.579
with such an important position

43:35.460 --> 43:37.420
because the treasury was empty.

43:38.019 --> 43:39.099
Who would have thought

43:39.579 --> 43:40.980
you would fill

43:41.460 --> 43:44.340
the Yu family's accounts
instead of the imperial treasury?

43:44.340 --> 43:46.260
The people's money

43:46.539 --> 43:47.420
ended up

43:47.539 --> 43:50.019
in your own pockets.

43:50.539 --> 43:51.699
I am innocent.

43:51.699 --> 43:52.380
Three days.

43:52.699 --> 43:54.099
The Three Judicial Offices shall,
within three days,

43:54.099 --> 43:56.179
jointly hear the case
of Grand Academician Yu Guodong.

43:56.300 --> 43:58.539
All those involved shall be severely
punished without exception.

43:59.300 --> 44:00.499
Commander Wang Yi of Gandu

44:00.499 --> 44:01.539
shall be stripped of his position

44:01.619 --> 44:03.099
for the unauthorized troop
mobilization matter.

44:03.260 --> 44:04.059
As a common subject,

44:04.059 --> 44:05.059
he shall assist in the investigation.

44:06.139 --> 44:08.300
Your Majesty is wise and just.

44:11.019 --> 44:12.900
Your Majesty is wise and just.

44:13.960 --> 44:17.560
(Revere Heaven and Honor the Ancestors)

44:18.960 --> 44:21.260
(Next Episode)

44:21.539 --> 44:23.260
What I desire,

44:23.740 --> 44:24.780
Jingxiu,

44:24.940 --> 44:27.099
you must do your utmost to fulfill.

44:28.219 --> 44:29.820
Who doesn't know about

44:29.820 --> 44:31.099
the things you've been doing?

44:31.579 --> 44:32.980
Do you think I have no one else

44:32.980 --> 44:34.260
to serve me in this court?

44:34.420 --> 44:36.300
Look at what has become
of the world outside!

44:36.300 --> 44:37.619
Even you, Madam,

44:37.619 --> 44:38.619
are nothing more

44:38.820 --> 44:40.179
than a vessel for men's power.

44:40.179 --> 44:41.179
But if I

44:41.860 --> 44:43.260
go to prison and face punishment,

44:43.260 --> 44:45.340
the Yu family will be finished.

44:45.340 --> 44:47.300
Have you come to take my life?

45:03.960 --> 45:08.280
♪The past brushes by
like a falling leaf♪

45:11.880 --> 45:16.240
♪So light, yet my steps still pause
for you♪

45:18.360 --> 45:23.000
♪Through every rise and fall,
our memories remain without regret♪

45:23.240 --> 45:26.040
♪Carved into the rings of time♪

45:27.200 --> 45:31.840
♪How I wish I could stay
a little longer, but I can't♪

45:35.040 --> 45:41.880
♪I turn away, afraid goodbye will fill
my eyes with tears♪

45:42.760 --> 45:49.280
♪Etched deep within my heart,
yet buried without a word♪

45:50.240 --> 45:53.680
♪The warmth of your hand in mine♪

45:54.200 --> 45:58.400
♪Still makes us want to believe♪

45:58.680 --> 46:04.360
♪One promise for a lifetime,
echoing long after we part♪

46:16.480 --> 46:20.360
♪For one fleeting moment, I found you
in the crowd♪

46:24.280 --> 46:28.280
♪Without a word, you lit up
half my life♪

46:30.000 --> 46:34.680
♪In silence, a love too deep for words♪

46:35.000 --> 46:37.680
♪Kept close within my heart♪

46:38.760 --> 46:43.600
♪From now on, no one else
is worth waiting for♪

46:47.120 --> 46:54.040
♪I turn away, afraid no one
will ever come home to me again♪

46:54.920 --> 47:01.400
♪If we can build our future together,
no storm can chill my heart♪

47:02.280 --> 47:05.800
♪The warmth of your hand in mine♪

47:06.240 --> 47:10.600
♪Still makes us want to believe♪

47:10.800 --> 47:16.520
♪One promise for a lifetime,
echoing long after we part♪
